## Architecture layers

```
src/
  domain/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/         # Entities + repository ports
  application/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/    # Use cases
  infrastructure/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/ # Flask Blueprint + repo adapter
```

- **domain/** — Pure domain model. No framework code.
- **application/** — Use cases expressing business intent.
- **infrastructure/** — Flask blueprints and SQLAlchemy repository implementations.

